<title>UK: Northern Electric finance director resigns.</title>
<headline>Northern Electric finance director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Electric said on Wednesday that its finance director John Edwards would be resigning from his post by the end of March, 1997.</p>
<p>Edwards' decision to resign came amidst organisational changes that Northern Electric is going through after its takeover by CalEnergy Company of the United States.</p>
<p>The UK firm appointed David Sokol, chairman and chief executive officer of CalEnergy, as Northern's chairman and chief executive officer last month.</p>
<p>Sokol said Edwards would assist the company to ensure a smooth transition.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
